use the methodology is already developed. Corrado is no longer being asked to invent the methodology; K3 is being used to challenge whether Chiave’s architecture faithfully implements it.\n\nSo the run is:\n\n> **Chiave → Corrado → Luce loop as needed → Ragno/K3 Swarm → Calibro/Grok → Talon → Keel → Luce**\n\nThat’s the pipeline.\n\n**SESSION FOOTER**\n- STATUS: PROCEED\n- NEXT ROUTE: Chiave\n- AFTER CHIAVE: Corrado/K3\n- VERIFICATION: Luce loop as required\n- PC PACKAGE: Ragno/K3 Swarm\n- IMPLEMENTATION DESIGN: Calibro/Grok 4.6\n- OPERATIONS: Talon\n- BUILD: Keel\n- FINAL VERIFICATION: Luce\n- DON INPUT NEEDED: only at material architecture/methodology decision gates", "text_chars": 2975, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "a4cdef2a-3d93-4ea9-9ab2-3063fcd533c4", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789688083.782317, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "thoughts", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "6685f01b-6e66-4b46-a9ec-99dc72e689a5", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789688083.799301, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "32e589eb-6ccc-45e6-9ba4-ed63434e4be1", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789688100.369, "updated_at": 17896881