ee promo; base $0.10/$0.20 | 1.05M | \"Contemplating\" mode runs parallel sub-agents; best for long-running agentic work, code, mixed text/vision. Contributor tier = your data feeds Meta. |\n[L18] | **Ling 3.0 Flash Fin Free** (`ling-3.0-flash-fin-free`) CONFIRMED | InclusionAI / Ling 3.0 | Financial-specialized fast MoE (124B, 5.1B active) | Zen free promo | 256K | Token-efficient finance text: filings, extraction, structured financial docs, constrained-budget agents. Specialist — not for general coding. |\n[L19] | **Nemotron 3.5 Lightning Free** (`nemotron-3.5-lightning-free`) CONFIRMED | NVIDIA / Nemotron | Fast reasoning tier | Zen free promo + NIM free | ~1M | Speed-to-quality for everyday agentic/coding; bulk throughput. |\n[L20] | **Muse Spark 1.2 Free** (`muse-spark-1.2-contributor-free`) INFERRED | Meta MSL / Muse | Coding-focused reasoning model | Zen Contributor free tier | 1M | Explicitly coding-focused Muse: codegen, debugging, codebase comprehension, dev workflows. |\n[L21] | **Nemotron 3 Ultra Free** (`nemotron-3-ultra-free`) CONFIRMED | NVIDIA / Nemotron | Flagship open MoE (550B, 55B active) | Zen free promo + NIM free | 1M | NVIDIA's open flagship — long-context agents, coding, tool-heavy runs. Consistently top-10 open model on OpenCode. |\n[L22] | **MiMo V2.5 Free** (`mimo-v2.5-free`) CONFIRMED | Xiaomi / MiMo | Native omni-modal agent (310B MoE, 15B active) | Zen free promo | 1M | Sees/hears/reads natively — image, video, audio understanding is its edge; ~50% fewer tokens than peers. Best free multimodal available with existing keys. |\n[L23] | **Big Pickle** (`opencode/big-pickle`) CONFIRMED | opencode | Free promo model | Zen free | — | Was running the session that produced this handbook. |\n\n---\n\n[L27] ## OPENROUTER — `:free` endpoints (serverless, rate-limited, can 502/disappear, community-funded)\n\n[L29] | Model | Lab / Family | Type (branding) | Free route | Ctx | Truth — what it excels at |\n[L30] |---|---|---|---|---|---|\n[L31] | **Ling 3.0 Flash VL (free)** INFERRED | InclusionAI / Ling 3.0 | Vision-language Flash | `:free` | 262K | Lean 124B MoE + vision input. Image-plus-agent workloads on a budget. |\n[L32] | **Nex-N2.5-Mini (free)** CONFIRMED | Nex-AGI / Nex N2.5 | Agentic open MoE (Qwen3.5-arch, Apache-2.0) | `:free` | 262K | Coding, tool use, deep research, long-horizon agent chains; smaller/faster than Pro. |\n[L33] | **Nex-N2.5-Pro (free)** CONFIRMED | Nex-AGI / Nex N2.5 | Agentic coding with visual feedback loop | `:free` | 262K | The standout: explores codebases, runs commands, launches & tests the app, sees results, retries. Best-in-class free autonomous SWE / GUI/computer-use QA. Free \"for now\" — promo risk. |\n[L34] | **Ling 3.0 Flash Sante (free)** FLAGGED | InclusionAI / Ling 3.0 | Health-tuned Flash (assumed) | `:free` | 262K | Could NOT confirm \"Sante\" verbatim as a published variant. Alias/renaming risk — treat as Ling-3.0-flash base until tested. |\n[L35] | **Ling 3.0 Flash Fin (free)** INFERRED | InclusionAI / Ling 3.0 | Finance-tuned Flash | `:free` + Zen | 256K | Same finance fast-lane as Zen entry. |\n[L36] | **Dots3-Note Preview (free)** CONFIRMED | Dots Studio / dots3 | Reasoning + multimodal MoE (280B/16B), open-weight | `:free` @ AtlasCloud | 512K | IMO-2026 champion lineage; strong reasoning. **Going away Sept 30, 2026** — ephemeral. |\n[L37] | **Qwen3.8 27B (free)** CONFIRMED | Alibaba / Qwen | Dense vision-language coder (Apache-2.0) | `:free` + NIM free | 262K (→1M) | 27B dense that beats Qwen3.7-Plus: coding, agentic, office automation, text+image. Best one-GPU coder on the list. |\n[L38] | **LFM2.5-2.6B (free)** INFERRED | Liquid AI / LFM | Small efficient generalist | `:free` | ~131K (approx) | Edge/high-throughput/tiny-budget work. A 2.6B won't run an agent fleet solo. |\n[L39] | **Nemotron 3.5 Lightning (free)** CONFIRMED | NVIDIA | Fast reasoning tier | `:free` | ~1M | Same model as the Zen free one — two routes, one brain. |\n[L40] | **DeepSeek V4 Flash 0731 (free)** CONFIRMED | DeepSeek / V4 | Efficient generalist (Flash tier) | `:free` + Zen + HF | 131K | **#1 most-used model in OpenCode.** The reliable free workhorse: everyday agentic/coding, high volume, correct-enough. 0731 = July-31 checkpoint build. |\n[L41] | **Inkling Small (free)** CONFIRMED | Thinking Machines / Inkling | Broad multimodal generalist (276B/12B MoE, Apache-2.0) | `:free` | 1M | Balanced foundation: agentic coding, strong speech/audio, calibrated confidence, controllable thinking effort. Underrated at $0. |\n[L42] | **Laguna S 2.1 (free)** INFERRED | Poolside / Laguna | Coding specialist | `:free` | 262K (family) | Written from scratch for code maintainability, not benchmark chasing. |\n[L43] | **Inkling (free)** CONFIRMED | Thinking Machines / Inkling | Flagship multimodal generalist (975B/41B MoE, Apache-2.0) | `:free` | 1M | Best open generalist on the list — coding agents, tools, fine-tunable via Tinker. Speech frontier among open weights. |\n[L44] | **Laguna XS 2.1 (free)** INFERRED | Poolside / Laguna | Compact coding specialist | `:free` | 262K (family) | Same coding DNA, faster/cheaper, lower ceiling. |\n[L45] | **Gemini Omni Flash Preview** FLAGGED | Google / Gemini | Omni (video/audio-in) flash preview | **No free tag** | ~1M | Treat as NOT free — preview served via OpenRouter without a free route in the screenshot. Verify before use. |\n[L46] | **North Mini Code (free)** CONFIRMED | Cohere / North | Compact coding model | `:free` | 256K | Cohere's small code-intent model — code gen/fix in constrained, cost-sensitive runners. |\n[L47] | **GLM 5.2 (free)** FLAGGED | Zhipu / GLM | Flagship MoE | `:free` route UNCONFIRMED | 1M | GLM-5.2 itself is a PAID flagship ($0.61/$1.98). The \"free\" tag is likely a transient route. Dependable free GLM = `z-ai/glm-4.7-flash-free`. Don't build on the 5.2 free route. |\n[L48] | **Nemotron 3 Ultra (free)** CONFIRMED | NVIDIA | Flagship open MoE | `:free` + NIM + Zen | 1M | See Zen row — same model. |\n[L49] | **Nemotron 3.5 Content Safety (free)** CONFIRMED | NVIDIA / Nemotron | **Guardrail classifier — NOT a generalist** | `:free` | 128K | Content-moderation judge. Vet other models' outputs, don't think for you. |\n[L50] | **Nemotron 3 Nano Omni (free)** CONFIRMED | NVIDIA / Nemotron | Small on-device omni (text/audio/vision/video) | `:free` | 256K | Edge-tier multimodal on cheap hardware. |\n[L51] | **Gemma 4 26B A4B (free)** INFERRED | Google / Gemma 4 | Open multimodal MoE (26B/4B active, vision) | `:free` + NIM | 262K | Efficient open vision+coding; 4B active makes it punchy for the size. |\n[L52] | **Gemma 4 31B (free)** INFERRED | Google / Gemma 4 | Open dense generalist | `:free` | 262K | Dense sibling — more reliable reasoning than 26B-A4B; vision cap unverified. |\n[L53] | **Nemotron 3 Super (free)** CONFIRMED | NVIDIA / Nemotron | Mid-tier open MoE (120B/12B) | `:free` | 262K | Balanced Nemotron — good general/coding middle ground if Ultra is overkill. |\n\n---\n\n[L57] ## GOOGLE (AI Studio / `google` provider — preview-tier, quota-limited, most \"genuinely free\" cloud lane)\n\n[L59] | Model | Lab / Family | Type (branding) | Free route | Ctx | Truth — what it excels at |\n[L60] |---|---|---|---|---|---|\n[L61] | **Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS Preview** INFERRED | Google / Gemini 3.1 | Speech (text→voice) flash variant | AI Studio free tier (quota) | n/a | Voices + VoiceBench-grade speech. Preview = demo-grade, replaceable. |\n[L62] | **Gemini 3.1 Flash Live Preview** INFERRED | Google / Gemini 3.1 | Realtime low-latency omni (voice/video turns) | AI Studio free tier (quota) | n/a | Live interplay use-cases, voice-bridge style. Auth through existing `google` key. |\n[L63] | **Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite Preview** INFERRED | Google / Gemini 3.1 | Smallest/cheapest generalist | AI Studio free tier (quota) | 1M | The \"always-free-tier\" Gemini lane. Note: 3.1 already superseded by 3.5/3.6 Flash — treat as legacy, verify live ID before wiring in. |\n\n---\n\n[L67] ## TRUTH TELLER'S FLAG LIST — do NOT trust as free as-is\n\n[L69] 1. **Gemini Omni Flash Preview** — no free tag → assume paid until proven.\n[L70] 2. **GLM 5.2 \"free\"** — flagship-paid model wearing a free route; depend on `glm-4.7-flash-free` instead.\n[L71] 3. **Dots3-Note Preview** — dies Sept 30, 2026; a *preview* with acknowledged instability.\n[L72] 4. **Ling 3.0 Flash Sante** — only name not independently verified as a distinct variant; treat as an alias of Ling 3.0 Flash until tested.\n[L73] 5. **Nex-N2.5 free routes** — free \"for now\" on a 397B model; they said it outright.\n[L74] 6. **All Zen free + all OpenRouter `:free`** — genuinely $0, but promo-termed, rate-limited, possibly data-trained, and can vanish overnight. Fine for a side quest; don't bet the pipeline on them.\n\n---\n\n[L78] Sources: OpenCode Zen docs (official free-model list + quotas), OpenRouter model pages, lab model cards (Nex-AGI, Dots Studio, Thinking Machines, Xiaomi MiMo, Meta Muse Spark, Qwen3.8-27B), FreeLLMAPI/ClawLabs free-tier trackers. Verified 2026-09-18.", "text_chars": 10513, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "d3d0f9d8-4e56-4275-a861-ede6c91436c0", "role": "tool", "role_name": "api_tool", "created_at": 1789719866.058245, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "The files uploaded in the current message have been fully loaded, so searching them will not provide additional information. However, some previously uploaded files were only partially loaded. If those files are relevant and the visible content is insufficient, you MUST use `files.search` to search their full content before responding. If the Files functions are not loaded, call `api_tool.list_resources` once with `paths=[\"files\"]` first