────────────────────────\r\n1. SESSION HEADER\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nReturn:\r\n\r\nCHAT / WORKSTREAM:\r\nPRIMARY DOMAIN:\r\n- GCE Framework\r\n- GCE Stack\r\n- Project\r\n- Personal\r\n- Job Search\r\n- Health\r\n- Travel\r\n- Other\r\n\r\nDATE RANGE COVERED:\r\nFIRST MATERIAL DATE:\r\nLAST MATERIAL DATE:\r\n\r\nPRIMARY AUTHORITY:\r\nPRIMARY SEATS INVOLVED:\r\nCURRENT STATUS:\r\n- ACTIVE\r\n- COMPLETE\r\n- PAUSED\r\n- SUPERSEDED\r\n- ARCHIVED\r\n- HANDOFF REQUIRED\r\n\r\nCONFIDENCE:\r\nGive a concise confidence percentage based only on evidence visible in this chat.\r\n\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n2. WHAT THIS CHAT WAS ACTUALLY ABOUT\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nGive a concise description of the real workstream.\r\n\r\nSeparate:\r\n- original objective;\r\n- major pivots;\r\n- final scope.\r\n\r\nDo not let early abandoned directions define the final summary.\r\n\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n3. ACCOMPLISHMENTS BY DATE\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nBuild a chronological record of MATERIAL accomplishments.\r\n\r\nFor each material date, state:\r\n\r\nDATE:\r\nWHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:\r\nDECISION / RESULT:\r\nWHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:\r\nSTATUS:\r\n- accepted\r\n- verified\r\n- implemented\r\n- proposed\r\n- rejected\r\n- superseded\r\n- experimental\r\n\r\nOnly include work that materially changed state, authority, implementation, or decisions.\r\n\r\nDo not produce a transcript summary.\r\n\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n4. FINAL ACCEPTED DECISIONS\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nList only decisions that survived to the end of the chat.\r\n\r\nFor each:\r\n\r\nDECISION:\r\nDATE ACCEPTED:\r\nAUTHORITY:\r\nSCOPE:\r\nSTATUS:\r\n- CANONICAL\r\n- PROJECT-CANONICAL\r\n- LOCAL / CHAT-ONLY\r\n- PROVISIONAL\r\n- SUPERSEDED\r\n\r\nIf something was discussed but never accepted, do NOT present it as canonical.\r\n\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n5. CANON / AUTHORITY CLASSIFICATION\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r