or automatic framework canon.\n\n---\n\n# 3. ACCOMPLISHMENTS BY DATE\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nBlack Pearl Trial 01 was established as a controlled sparse-evidence model audition. A frozen MLB slate was used to compare model reasoning under uncertainty without browsing, Don prior, Quant conclusions, or other analysts' outputs.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nThe useful question changed from “which model is best?” to **“what cognitive job does each model naturally perform?”**\n\n**WHO / WHICH SEAT OWNED IT:**  \nDon authority; Coda synthesis/governance; independent model runtimes served as experimental workers.\n\n**STATUS:** experimental, accepted as evidence\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nA provisional model-labor map emerged.\n\nObserved useful fits included:\n\n- GPT-5.6 Sol — bounded senior analyst / grounded first read;\n- Nex N2.5 Pro — grounded skeptic / evidence-price tension;\n- Muse Spark 1.3 — pattern analyst;\n- Dots3 — anomaly hunter;\n- Grok 4.6 — contradiction cross-examiner;\n- Kimi K3 High — methodology challenger;\n- Big Pickle — verifier / truth-teller;\n- GLM 5.1 / 5.3-class — architecture/integration work when stage-matched.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nModels should be assessed by **job-fit and failure signature**, not leaderboard rank.\n\n**OWNER:** Coda synthesis under Don authority.\n\n**STATUS:** experimental evidence; later generalized into Technical Strategy research\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nEC3 / EC4 history was reviewed.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nThe useful historical functions were retained, while the centralized end-stage gatekeeper pattern was judged less desirable than distributed:\n\ngrounding → challenge → verification → integration → Don.\n\nEC4's excessive fusion/transformation complexity was treated as a lesson against overbuilding.\n\n**OWNER:** Don + Coda.\n\n**STATUS:** accepted as design lesson; not a direct implementation command\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nThe four-lane Edge Crew concept was clarified:\n\n1. EC Quant  \n2. EC Matrix  \n3. EC AI Convergence  \n4. EC Committee / Ship\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nThese are separate methodological lanes, not one giant serial pipeline.\n\nActive sequencing became:\n\n**Quant first → AI Convergence next → observe → Matrix and Ship only if earned.**\n\n**OWNER:** Don authority; Coda framing.\n\n**STATUS:** accepted conceptual/project architecture; later project authority remained with the dedicated Edge Crew project\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nAI Convergence was conceptually structured around:\n\nindependent factual reads → contradiction challenge → methodology challenge → verification → integration → Don.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nNo majority vote, no hidden final gatekeeper, no premature master AI score.\n\n**OWNER:** Don + Coda.\n\n**STATUS:** proposed/design-level; not production canon\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nHistorical Don/Kimi methodology was recovered and recognized as important lineage:\n\nDon Human Pass 1 frozen → independent Quant → compare → DIG DEEPER targeted evidence → reconcile → Don.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nThe current independence doctrine was recognized as a formalization of an already-existing operating discipline, not something invented by Black Pearl.\n\n**OWNER:** Don prior methodology; Coda reconciliation.\n\n**STATUS:** accepted historical methodology evidence\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED:**  \nA progressive-evidence pattern was identified.\n\n**DECISION / RESULT:**  \nA system may benefit from:\n\nbounded first read → disagreement/blocker discovery → targeted evidence expansion → challenge/verification → final decision surface.\n\n**OWNER:** Coda extraction from Don/Kimi historical process.\n\n**STATUS:** candidate reusable methodology; not universal canon by itself\n\n---\n\n## 2026-09-18\n\n**WHAT WAS ACCOMPLISHED